The core agent-decisions template with only `name` and `step` set: `asked`, `decision` and
`why` have no default in it, so the run exits 1 with one line naming all three, sorted, and
writes nothing — no traceback, and an empty receipt, which a run that created the directory
could never print.

-- cmd --
booping create core.agent_decisions.template agent-decisions --set name=present --set step=groom/present
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: core.agent_decisions.template needs --set asked, decision, why
